# Programs lxsession starts with the LXDE session.
#
# The panel and the desktop are autostart entries, not lxsession built-ins, so
# they have to be listed here. nm-applet and blueman-applet are not listed:
# both ship /etc/xdg/autostart entries, which lxsession already runs.
@lxpanel --profile LXDE
@pcmanfm --desktop --profile LXDE
